  "description": "KAMMUJ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C96 H90 Dy6 N8 O26. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3B (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 11 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.475-3.845 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 85.90-118.69°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C96H90Dy6N8O26. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
